$C = "../Common.ui";
Group {
    ## DESC

    Quick Access Items (Toolbelts and more) is a plugin designed to solve my biggest gripe with block games; the hotbar.
    The plugin allows the player to not clutter up their hotbar with tools by placing them in their own container and 
    allowing the user to use a radial menu to quickly swap between items on the menu.
    
    ## USEAGE
        - Holding the item and left-clicking will open the Selection GUI
        - Holding the item and right-clicking will open the Storage GUI
        - The player needs to enable quick swap to convert their hotbar slot
        - Dropping the item and running the equip button
            will still run the gui logic 1 last time and revert their selected hotbar slot before the player data gets updated
            (This is a hytale limitation due to multithreading and inablity to use itemDropEvent)

    ## DEFAULTS
        - Eqipping: The item is required to be placed in hotbar slot 9 to be "Eqipped"
        - Target: Items from swapping are swapped with hotbar slot 1 when selected

    ## FUTURE PLANS
        - Implement Different tiers of Items
            - common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic etc

        - Implement different types of Quick Access Items with different bonus's and limitiations
            - Bandolier's (Consumables Only)
            - Toolbelts (Tools Only)
            - Builders Puch (Blocks only)

        - Add Custom Models & Model Animations

        - Add Item Block Entites to item so they can be placed in the world and used as chests 
            - Shift click auto equips item?

        - Allow players to set what hotbar slot counts as Equipped
        - Allow players to set what hotbar slot items get placed into
        - Allow players to let swap happen to selected hotbar slot vs defined

        - Improve Ui design

}